    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a helpful overview of the current direction of the Court. For the sake of a balanced lecture, could you elaborate on the theoretical and scholarly foundations of the living constitutionalist approach? I want to make sure my students understand the internal logic used by those who argue that the Constitution must evolve alongside societal changes, rather than just seeing it as a movement that has been sidelined.",
